{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "413615a6471b4ef21c04bb0eb6c935597bce28aa424cea9f914623d41f4d5e45", "ja": "反逆者たち", "zh": "叛逆者们", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "09d369ce714f231f5b99a07cd615de7d78fd1e08e2361279bef5fe6b35f1f8c8", "ja": "やがて六学都を襲うとされる『大忘却』……\n歩は、その運命に抗う組織『反忘却同盟』の\n幹部であった。そしてジュリアは、深青書院\nに背き、行方をくらませた元『司書』。お互\nいの素性を知り、共感しあう二人。", "zh": "据传不久后将袭击六学都的“大忘却”……\n步是反抗这一命运的组织“反忘却同盟”的\n干部。而茱莉亚，则是背叛了深青书院\n并销声匿迹的前“司书”。知晓了彼此的\n底细后，两人心意相通。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1000_null", "source_sha256": "c83b66a4653000e04251c70eb1bdd774a690788cdf3696ad6c1ef7a0fa3e9901", "ja": "ザワザワ……ザワザワ……", "zh": "吵杂……吵杂……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1001_005yay", "source_sha256": "fbbabcb5d5f52091b46cc83af9654b96f6d1d116d43665a2ed3e38b223a49018", "ja": "わあ……すごいですー！\n裏路地の奥に、こんな街があるなんて……。", "zh": "哇……好厉害啊——！\n小巷深处居然还有这样一座城镇……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1002_001har", "source_sha256": "049191fcfe09c7150c84b9c95e6531db44d0a4b7c8a20e58c26118aa5c5ef902", "ja": "ここって、暁陽の学都なんですか？　何番地なのかな？\n……あ、あれ？　地図に載ってない？", "zh": "这里就是晓阳的学都吗？这是第几号街区呢？\n……啊，咦？地图上没有标出来？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d466ca05bb6521cb52b842ffa543ef948b2d6c95cc9b263394595d7fd4a33996", "ja": "ここは、忘れられた街。誰にも覚えておいて\nもらえなかった、記憶の隙間みたいなところだよ。", "zh": "这里是被遗忘的城市。是个没人记得，\n仿佛夹在记忆缝隙里的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "fbace7ad0bd84847cde6635322cdc70d0ab3e49f6a0989e374cfa86c833254c9", "ja": "アタシ達は、こういうところに幾つか拠点を持ってる。\nここなら連中に見つかることもないから……", "zh": "我们在这种地方有几个据点。\n在这里也不会被那帮人发现……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1005_tuukounina", "source_sha256": "bb38692b642028a686b107fa1d7843877d3e2bab604464eb3a846e55c7ed8278", "ja": "あっ！　歩さんだ！　レッツダンス！（ビシッ）", "zh": "啊！是步小姐！来跳舞吧！（唰！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1006_tuukouninb", "source_sha256": "448c1f0dc973b86f398c75b3ec4642555bce48fc9705691a660c2dc6214e269d", "ja": "レッツダンスです！（ビシッ）", "zh": "一起跳舞吧！（利落地敬礼）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "125163b4dad326b34b63877e4cc210e84c1adadb0d3c34202023fcc56345129b", "ja": "あ、ああ……レッツダンス！", "zh": "啊、啊啊……一起跳舞吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "5ceaddbbf0b805189c76872919ffbd07c103f75045e1003e00588d0ebe0f0130", "ja": "歩、お前、ナニモンなんだよ？\nただのストリートダンサーじゃなかったのか？", "zh": "步，你到底是什么人啊？\n你不是普通的街舞舞者吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6c2320b9e70ad45c7ee817fc39a8937c277020b169594c763aac433ff215686e", "ja": "ただのダンサーだってば。ストリートで踊ってたら\n仲間が増えて、頼られるようになっちゃっただけ。", "zh": "都说了，我只是个普通的舞者啦。在街头跳舞的时候，伙伴越来越多，不知不觉就变得受大家依赖了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "cb8164ffcab13b012f6c7058bd5f01a48ffd256ddb4688b1cbb001f75d96da85", "ja": "逃げてきたヤツとか、居場所を失くしたヤツとか……\n今は『反忘却同盟』って名乗ってる。", "zh": "像是逃出来的家伙，或是失去了容身之处的家伙……现在自称『反忘却同盟』。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "5852ea65ba4321a396b8a4f80961d0a85b8749361d5cca069cf2b041d7026582", "ja": "『反忘却同盟』って……最近ニュースとかで見る、\nあの！？　あちこちで暴れてるって……！", "zh": "“反忘却同盟”……就是最近新闻里经常提到的那个！？听说他们在各地闹事……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "64d53ac9f0710e3df34e9d5951b5fc57c2ca85b5258dd86572360c4dfbab166f", "ja": "いやいや、それちょっと大げさなんだって！\n一般の人に手を出したりしないよ。", "zh": "不不不，那也太夸张了！\n我们才不会对普通人出手呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2aa7447bc02dc57c0a14d5c1a14047e657835998aba00a24e32c1966a3276879", "ja": "今ウワサの『大忘却』ってあるでしょ？　アタシ達は、\nあれを止めたいだけだから！　怖くないって。", "zh": "现在大家都在传的“大遗忘”，你知道吧？我们只是想阻止那个而已！没什么好怕的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1014_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6b84f06649817943992a3e7bb8c8d8b27c046883db7eb73463d5da59ce26b0dc", "ja": "とにかく、ジュリアもそっちの2人も、好きなだけ\nいていいからさ。どうするか、ゆっくり考えなよ。", "zh": "总之，茱莉亚和你那边的2个人，想待多久都可以。慢慢考虑该怎么办吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1015_005yay", "source_sha256": "dcb3672a8410940e680d4d85e50d984277b57c996b2a8b0a26cb22b7fcdf4d91", "ja": "……うーん……うーん？　うーん……。", "zh": "……嗯……嗯？嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "dc0e15bc47d6f45da1ecac97b2c947c653afaf104cba24369cd7b3536d1b8db3", "ja": "おーい、ヤッ……やよい！\nなにやってんだ？　難しい顔して。", "zh": "喂——呀……弥生！\n你在干什么呢？怎么一脸苦恼的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1017_005yay", "source_sha256": "03f78825e5951e2dea55814f70ef25361c45b482704f8630b0e8f9bda751779a", "ja": "はわっ！？　ジュリアさん！　えっと……\n考えてたんです。これからどうしようかなーって。", "zh": "呀！？茱莉亚先生！那个……\n我刚才在想，接下来该怎么办才好呢——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1018_005yay", "source_sha256": "952a08b7ca3386ef9812f5dba0c8bd9a13708ec6076441b70532f6b5b466260e", "ja": "学校の出席も気になるし、早く帰りたいんですけど。\nそうすると、捕まっちゃうんですよね……。", "zh": "也很担心学校的出勤率，虽然想快点回去。\n但要是那样的话，又会被抓住呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1019_005yay", "source_sha256": "f6ae237405e3e07af430a5f408d694a7de25e22b4c6e0bad633d7c23ecc7984e", "ja": "でも『大忘却』が起きたら、\n全部忘れちゃうかもしれなくて……うーん？", "zh": "可是，如果发生了“大遗忘”，说不定会把一切都忘掉……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "7d52488f363f92d1f9535dad46cf137274d58b1c2e434597a6b55e459226a7b8", "ja": "……。\nやよいは……忘れたくないことがあるのか？", "zh": "……\n弥生……有不想忘记的事情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1021_005yay", "source_sha256": "5ce291fc10e1207e7f19f37d4a44c06898bcb1ea6a698ca20a18fe37c9f62e34", "ja": "いっぱいあります！　友達のことも、家族のことも\n……学校のことも、毎日のことも。", "zh": "有很多很多！朋友的事情、家人的事情\n……学校的事情、每天发生的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1022_005yay", "source_sha256": "fafc0f402e83f8b54758ae7d406ce078f9baab2d4620f7723700714e895e8228", "ja": "全部全部、ぜーんぶ、私の大切な思い出です！\n一個もなくしたくない、宝物だなーって。", "zh": "全都是、全都是——全部都是我珍贵的回忆！\n一件都不想弄丢，都是我的宝物呢——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1023_050jul", "source_sha256": "ac659509065f95e76016abeed5b41b01cc7a362cd7b789d7ad84347a73f5c084", "ja": "そっか……よかったな。", "zh": "这样啊……那就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1024_005yay", "source_sha256": "754f3f2e63c333d7f3b498cfcfea23539af6d321dbb074c99f8e453ba16404bd", "ja": "……？　ジュリアさん？", "zh": "……？　茱莉亚先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1025_050jul", "source_sha256": "fe7a95fc7de3d6bbb962342ed125a8f9d335953b2201d4d38073daa778072245", "ja": "あ、いや、ええと……そうだ！　友達って言えば、\n一緒にいた……ハル？　とかってヤツ、仲いいのか？", "zh": "啊，不，那个……对了！说到朋友，\n和你一起的……哈露？还是叫啥来着，跟你关系很好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1026_005yay", "source_sha256": "7407716a3e0728eeafe145a0abc8ace4e8f53528fbe06567b87dd6613e2014c1", "ja": "春香さんですか？　はい！　カゲロウの生徒さんで、\n暁陽の学都で買い物してた時に知り合ったんです。", "zh": "春香小姐吗？是的！她是影狼的学生，\n我们是在晓阳学都购物的时候认识的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1027_005yay", "source_sha256": "9a89109a3a46f6d4f7b9c4efeee6fa0bca176095cd0ef4d7c66dc194705074a7", "ja": "お互い、おのぼりさんだなーってすぐにわかって。\nそれから、一緒に買い物に行くようになって……。", "zh": "我们很快就发现，彼此都是第一次来大城市的人。\n从那以后，就开始一起去买东西了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1028_034ayu", "source_sha256": "28fcfe77373a921bb39a2d6ce2f486579a4dfc370b29265aff5007f23c716724", "ja": "っと、いたいた！　ジュリア、\nちょっと、来てもらっていい？　話があるんだ。", "zh": "啊，找到了找到了！茱莉亚，能过来一下吗？我有话要跟你说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1029_034ayu", "source_sha256": "df81cb8eb4bd2137bf6773b9c5058e8b2419f92cf3e4f65b64da5fa4d9f9f892", "ja": "最初に言っておくけど、これはただの確認だから。\n責めたりするつもりはないよ。オッケー？", "zh": "先说好，这只是确认一下。我没有要责怪你的意思。好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1030_050jul", "source_sha256": "91f6028b8306b9bc7ef862eac0af199258b0e1d239b1ecc57b0d54e109b2d274", "ja": "ああ……オッケーだ。何でも聞いてくれ。", "zh": "啊……行。你尽管问吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1031_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8d1205a3a9689bf03c8c3cc95c6eab555b80c31639c62a422b1a77fd6e0147c2", "ja": "うん。えっと、ここには深青の生徒もいてさ……\nそいつらが、ジュリアのことを知ってるって言うんだ。", "zh": "嗯。那个，这里也有深青的学生在……\n他们说，自己认识茱莉亚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1032_034ayu", "source_sha256": "1981321428a15d5c14db16ef69ac5f63d6eb63e5783b4cb08bf6741b0ef68ec9", "ja": "深青書院の元『司書』で、自分に関する記憶を\n全部消して行方をくらました、反逆者だって。", "zh": "据说是深青书院的前『图书管理员』，一个抹去了所有关于自己的记忆、销声匿迹的叛逆者。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1033_050jul", "source_sha256": "da4a693b248ed73f1698a725aa0b2ff19c2da144ae5d57fc4dae302a9fb13dc3", "ja": "……。ああ、合ってるよ。\n消しきれなかったもんで、指名手配されてるけどな。", "zh": "……。啊，你说得没错。\n虽然没能彻底抹掉，搞得现在还被通缉就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1034_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6b27ea8fa861f52e89d73adbe0349fafcb8f658ae17a445b7e70431f6403cee1", "ja": "そっか……。\nなんでそんなことしたのか、理由を聞いてもいい？", "zh": "这样啊……\n我能问问你为什么要那么做吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1035_050jul", "source_sha256": "561f8e53c2e7ca870a33c1b6d63302f4521e0da4e9a0d8e000431f15a5cb34cb", "ja": "簡単な話だよ。ただ、気に食わなかった。\n……深青の『司書』がどういう存在か、知ってるよな？", "zh": "很简单。只是看不顺眼而已。\n……你知道深青的“图书管理员”是怎样的存在吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1036_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ad090f262537d25fd481493dc54ef34273b4ee7cf389cda538f7b64abdc5ca03", "ja": "えっと……『大忘却』を超えて記憶を残しておける、\n生きた記憶媒体……だったっけ？", "zh": "呃……是能够跨越“大遗忘”保存记忆的活体记忆载体……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1037_050jul", "source_sha256": "92a1c2754fb96bc6cbb87dad4fbd312369b41f9816ad8e4b82be48afcf801105", "ja": "そうそう。けど、脳の容量には限界があるだろ？\nだから『司書』は、大事な情報以外、消されるのさ。", "zh": "对对。不过，脑容量是有限的吧？所以『图书管理员』会把重要信息以外的东西都删除掉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1038_050jul", "source_sha256": "03b20f531a31ea0af3fe86893cae873cc528381e30934ee28d2d1a1829303572", "ja": "好きな音楽も、感動した映画の内容も……\n全部、要らない記憶だって。ふざけんな、だろ？", "zh": "喜欢的音乐也好，让人感动的电影内容也罢……\n全都被当成不需要的记忆。开什么玩笑，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1039_050jul", "source_sha256": "9d2d432d30ffa56d9bfec8c74e117290f856475ac22e1dca134a61e2c5ca6af9", "ja": "何を覚えておきたいかは、あたしが決める！\nだから……全部、ぶっ壊してやろうと思ったんだ。", "zh": "想记住什么，由我自己决定！\n所以……我才想着把这一切全都毁掉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1040_050jul", "source_sha256": "377df5bbd708b46b1c0d90ccecc7526ca2c7dad62ae031f111f9bd150c6ef75f", "ja": "ま、迷惑を掛ける気はないよ。\n邪魔にならないうちに、出ていくさ。それじゃ……。", "zh": "算了，我没打算给你们添麻烦。\n趁还没碍事，我这就走。回见……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1041_034ayu", "source_sha256": "877d78f8afed38f6af9cab564362ea271cae90f832e30502db708c580879dc89", "ja": "……待って！　それって、めちゃくちゃ\nロックじゃん！　気に入ったよ、ジュリア！", "zh": "……等等！那不是超级\n摇滚嘛！我很中意你哦，茱莉亚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_03_1042_050jul", "source_sha256": "30362da1fa806e6c8857225ddfb7e58d9e984fbe2aa2bada800c09ee52b9011d", "ja": "は……はあ？", "zh": "哈……哈啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
